# DVSM Core Equation: Complete Derivation with Axioms, Layers, Derivatives, and Observational Constraints

**Project:** DVSM v3.3 (Deterministic State-Evolution Manifold)  
**Platform:** Xbox Ally X (Zen 5 Z2 Extreme)  
**Date:** 2026-05-21  
**Author:** Daniel J. Dillberg
